===Vaultberries Clothing Guys & Girls===
Vaultberries are seeds growing out of the [[Royal Vault]] that can be purchased in the marketplace or from Gulsh located outside the Royal Vault in Sanctuary. These seeds can be planted in your farm and take one day to harvest, but if you want to speed up the process purchase and use fertilizer to reduce the harvesting time from one day to 12 hours. When harvested, vaultberries give random items in any of Free Realms's colors. Here are the possible rewards.

